{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject"]]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(_:)-2mf3j","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(_:)-47vjm","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(_:)-5hv9g","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(_:)-75qw1","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(_:)-9532m","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(cPointer:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(constPointer:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(gconstpointer:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(gpointer:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(mutating:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/init(opaquePointer:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/ptr"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/PointerWrapper-Implementations","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef\/TypePluginProtocol-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/4GLib14PointerWrapperP","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginProtocol"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TypePluginRef","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The GObject type system supports dynamic loading of types.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It goes as follows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The type is initially introduced (usually upon loading the module"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the first time, or by your main application that knows what modules","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"introduces what types), like this:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"c","code":["new_type_id = g_type_register_dynamic (parent_type_id,","                                       \"TypeName\",","                                       new_type_plugin,","                                       type_flags);"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"where "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"new_type_plugin"},{"type":"text","text":" is an implementation of the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTypePlugin"},{"text":" interface.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The type’s implementation is referenced, e.g. through"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"[func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.TypeClass.ref"},{"type":"text","text":"] or through [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.type_create_instance"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(this is being called by [ctor","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.Object.new"},{"text":"]) or through one of the above","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"done on a type derived from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"new_type_id"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This causes the type system to load the type’s implementation by calling","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"[method","type":"text"},{"code":"GObject.TypePlugin.use","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] and [method"},{"code":"GObject.TypePlugin.complete_type_info","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"]","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on "},{"code":"new_type_plugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"At some point the type’s implementation isn’t required anymore, e.g. after","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"code":"GObject.TypeClass.unref","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] or [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.type_free_instance"},{"text":"]","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(called when the reference count of an instance drops to zero)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This causes the type system to throw away the information retrieved","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from [method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.TypePlugin.complete_type_info"},{"type":"text","text":"] and then it calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"code":"GObject.TypePlugin.unuse","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"new_type_plugin"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Things may repeat from the second step."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"So basically, you need to implement a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTypePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" type that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries a use_count, once use_count goes from zero to one, you need"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to load the implementation to successfully handle the upcoming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.TypePlugin.complete_type_info"},{"text":"] call. Later, maybe after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"succeeding use\/unuse calls, once use_count drops to zero, you can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"unload the implementation again. The type system makes sure to call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"[method","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.TypePlugin.use"},{"text":"] and [method","type":"text"},{"code":"GObject.TypePlugin.complete_type_info","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again when the type is needed again.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"[class"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypeModule","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"] is an implementation of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTypePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already implements most of this except for the actual module loading and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unloading. It even handles multiple registered types per module.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef"},{"type":"text","text":" type acts as a lightweight Swift reference to an underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTypePlugin"},{"text":" instance.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It exposes methods that can operate on this data type through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginProtocol","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef","isActive":true},{"text":" only as an ","type":"text"},{"code":"unowned","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reference to an existing "},{"code":"GTypePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (instead of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/TypePluginRef"},{"type":"text","text":") if you want to use Automatic Reference Counting for memory management of the underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTypePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glibobject\/typepluginref"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An interface that handles the lifecycle of dynamically loaded types."}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10GLibObject13TypePluginRefV","modules":[{"name":"GLibObject"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypePluginRef"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","title":"TypePluginRef","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypePluginRef"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/TypePluginProtocol/type_plugin_ptr-1f7zf":{"url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/typepluginprotocol\/type_plugin_ptr-1f7zf","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"type_plugin_ptr","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "}